{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "照片一是臺灣某地一間廢棄屋牆壁的廣告。該廣告最可能出現在下列何處？", "options": {"A": "埔里盆地", "B": "竹苗丘陵", "C": "雲嘉沿海", "D": "澎湖群島"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 88.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 98.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 73.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 88.0, "p_high": 98.0, "p_low": 73.0, "discrimination": 25.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 96.0, 93.0, 86.0, 65.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "近年來，政府積極鼓勵鄉村地區發展特色產業、舉辦節慶活動，\n例如客家桐花季、古坑咖啡節等。這些措施可能對鄉村地區帶來\n下列哪些改變？甲、外來遊客人數大量增加；乙、中心商業區的\n逐漸成形；丙、都市化程度的明顯提升；丁、社區風貌及景觀的\n改善；戊、地方特色商品市場擴大。", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙", "B": "甲丁戊", "C": "乙丙戊", "D": "丙丁戊 照片一"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 97.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 99.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 94.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 1.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 97.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 94.0, "discrimination": 5.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 99.0, 98.0, 97.0, 92.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "照片二是一張由南向北拍攝的風積地形照片。\n此種地形的塑造，主要受盛行風的影響：迎風\n坡成凸形緩坡，背風坡則成凹形陡坡。根據盛\n行風向判斷，該照片最可能位於下列何處？", "options": {"A": "祕魯西北部的塞丘拉沙漠", "B": "澳洲西北部的大沙地沙漠", "C": "埃及西南部的撒哈拉沙漠 照片二", "D": "中國西部塔克拉瑪干沙漠"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 26.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 31.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 28.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 35.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 23.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 32.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 31.0, "p_high": 35.0, "p_low": 32.0, "discrimination": 3.0, "p_quintiles": [39.0, 27.0, 26.0, 29.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某學者利用 1992-1994 年間繪製的 1:5000 土地利用調查圖，和 2005 年拍攝的福衛二號衛\n星圖，分析 1990 年代到 2000 年代臺灣某都市土地利用的變遷趨勢。初步結果發現：甲、\n道路的面積減少約 10%；乙、耕地減少約 4%；丙、建地增加約 15%；丁、林地變化極微，\n河川、湖泊等水體面積大致不變。這些初步結果，哪些變遷趨勢最可能符合實際情況？", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙", "B": "甲乙丁", "C": "甲丙丁", "D": "乙丙丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 36.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 60.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 22.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 77.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 48.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 42.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 60.0, "p_high": 77.0, "p_low": 42.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [81.0, 69.0, 60.0, 51.0, 37.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "1992 年聯合國於里約全球高峰會提倡：「地方政府應扮演倡導、溝通與資源供給者\n的角色。」我國政府在《國土空間發展策略計畫》中，也特別將「如何將都市獨特\n的文化更進一步反映、融合與固化於都市景觀、建設、產業、居住環境及居民的認\n同感中，從而提升都市的競爭力。」列為都市區域發展重點。聯合國高峰會的提倡\n和我國政府的都市區域發展重點，係以下列哪個理念為基礎？", "options": {"A": "環境負載力", "B": "全球在地化", "C": "區域差異與均衡", "D": "城鄉供需互補作用"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 31.0, "C": 60.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 34.0, "C": 60.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 28.0, "C": 58.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 31.0, "p_high": 34.0, "p_low": 28.0, "discrimination": 6.0, "p_quintiles": [36.0, 32.0, 30.0, 29.0, 27.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖一是某項資料在 1965-2025 年的世界變化趨\n勢圖。該圖係根據下列哪項資料繪製而成？", "options": {"A": "勞動力", "B": "貿易額", "C": "汽車數量", "D": "國內生產毛額"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 63.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 18.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 80.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 46.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 29.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 63.0, "p_high": 80.0, "p_low": 46.0, "discrimination": 34.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 72.0, 62.0, 55.0, 42.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "臺 灣 某 都 市 市 政 府 為 解 決 都 市 公 共 設 施 不\n足的問題，鼓勵民間自行設置休憩設施，允\n許於住宅區、商業區、文教區內設置遊憩設\n施，工業區、風景區及保護區等地區，則是\n有條件設置。另外，並規定社區的遊憩設施\n為非營利性、屬社區之附屬設施性質，惟設\n置比例不得超過總樓地板面積之 15%。該市\n圖一\n政府鼓勵民間自行設置休憩設施的內容，最\n符合下列哪項規定的精神？", "options": {"A": "開放空間使用辦法", "B": "公共設施使用許可", "C": "土地使用分區管制", "D": "社區總體營造條例\n- 1 -\n100年指考 第 2 頁\n地理考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 38.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 29.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 42.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 22.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 31.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 36.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 26.0, "p_high": 32.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 10.0, "p_quintiles": [34.0, 27.0, 24.0, 24.0, 20.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖二是某四個地區的都市和鄉村人口成長趨勢圖。哪\n個地區的都市化歷程速度最快？", "options": {"A": "甲", "B": "乙", "C": "丙", "D": "丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 85.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 94.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 73.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 85.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 73.0, "discrimination": 21.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 91.0, 87.0, 82.0, 69.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "美國黑人作家胡克斯（Bell Hooks，1952-）寫道：\n「身為居住在肯塔基州小鎮的美國黑人，鐵道每日\n都提醒了我們邊緣處境。跨越鐵道之後，是有鋪面\n的 街 道 ， 是 我 們 不 能 進 入 的 商 店 和 不 能 用 餐 的 餐\n廳，以及我們不能直視臉龐的人群。鐵道那頭，是\n我們可以擔任女僕、工友和娼妓工作的世界。我們\n可以進入那個世界，卻不能在那裡生活。」美國小 圖二\n鎮鐵道兩側呈現明顯不同生活方式的主要原因是：", "options": {"A": "主流社會的種族歧視", "B": "因應城鄉供需互補關係", "C": "促進城鎮邊緣發展的策略", "D": "黑白種族的地方認同差異"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 89.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 95.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 80.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 89.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 80.0, "discrimination": 15.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 93.0, 91.0, 88.0, 76.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一項研究指出：「近年來全球通貨膨脹居高不下，和工業產品價格大致穩定或下跌，\n而能源和食品價格卻持續飆升有關。」工業產品價格穩定或下跌、能源和食品價格\n飆升的原因，和下列哪項事實關係最密切？", "options": {"A": "日本自2005年以來海外投資規模不斷擴大", "B": "中國挾世界工廠和新興資本市場之姿進入全球經濟體系", "C": "受美國金融市場影響，歐元區經濟在2008年出現明顯下滑", "D": "2007年非洲商品和服務出口額成長15.2%，進口額成長13.2%"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 76.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 91.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 56.0, "C": 36.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 76.0, "p_high": 91.0, "p_low": 56.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 86.0, 80.0, 69.0, 49.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖中圓餅符號代表的意涵，可能有：甲、圓餅面積大小\n表示疫情的規模；乙、圓餅的位置顯示霍亂是地方病；\n丙、圓餅面積大小表示病床數多寡；丁、圓餅的位置代\n表霍亂發生地點。其中正確的有哪兩項？", "options": {"A": "甲乙", "B": "乙丙", "C": "丙丁", "D": "甲丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "11-12", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 10.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 70.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 78.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 61.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 70.0, "p_high": 78.0, "p_low": 61.0, "discrimination": 17.0, "p_quintiles": [80.0, 74.0, 70.0, 66.0, 58.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列哪條河川下游地區，霍亂的疫情最為嚴重？", "options": {"A": "烏溪", "B": "濁水溪", "C": "高屏溪", "D": "淡水河\n圖三"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "11-12", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 49.0, "C": 40.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 17.0, "B": 47.0, "C": 36.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 50.0, "C": 43.0, "D": 1.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 11.0, "p_high": 17.0, "p_low": 6.0, "discrimination": 11.0, "p_quintiles": [21.0, 11.0, 9.0, 7.0, 6.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "如果福島核電廠外洩的輻射物質影響到臺灣，最可能是以下列何種方式影響？", "options": {"A": "隨著黑潮影響臺灣沿海漁業資源", "B": "隨著中國沿岸流影響臺灣沿海漁業資源", "C": "隨著蒙古高壓外圍環流擴散到臺灣陸地上空", "D": "隨著太平洋高壓外圍環流擴散到臺灣陸地上空"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "13-14", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 15.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 41.0, "D": 26.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 64.0, "D": 16.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 26.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 36.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 41.0, "p_high": 64.0, "p_low": 19.0, "discrimination": 45.0, "p_quintiles": [70.0, 52.0, 40.0, 29.0, 15.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "從 日 本 東 北 大 地 震 對 臺 灣 高 科 技 產 業的影響，說明臺灣與日本產業的關係相當緊\n密。此種關係最適合以下列哪個概念說明？", "options": {"A": "跨國企業", "B": "技術移轉", "C": "區位擴散", "D": "空間分工鏈\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 100年指考\n共 7 頁 地理考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "13-14", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 81.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 94.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 23.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 63.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 81.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 63.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 91.0, 85.0, 76.0, 56.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
