{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "如果未來在相同的降雨狀態下，該地水文歷線的\n「洪峰」點卻呈現向左偏移的情形，最可能反映\n下列哪種現象？", "options": {"A": "測站上游植被遭受破壞", "B": "測站上游興築大型水庫 7月18日 7月19日 7月20日", "C": "測站下游開始興築堤防", "D": "測站下游大量引水灌溉 圖四"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "17-18", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 80.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 96.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 57.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 80.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 57.0, "discrimination": 39.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 93.0, 89.0, 77.0, 45.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "相對於防波堤，蚵仔寮和花蓮南濱公園發生海岸侵蝕、濱線後退的位置並不相同，\n造成此差異的最直接因素是：", "options": {"A": "兩地潮差的大小差異", "B": "兩地沿岸海水的深度差異", "C": "兩地沿岸流方向不同", "D": "兩地受颱風侵襲頻率不同"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "19-20", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 83.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 96.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 65.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 83.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 65.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 94.0, 88.0, 79.0, 57.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列哪種研究方法，可以同時應用於南濱公園與蚵仔寮環境問題的快速研判？", "options": {"A": "調閱清代繪製古地圖進行疊圖分析", "B": "調閱築堤前後相片基本圖進行比對", "C": "親赴現場進行沿岸風向與風速測量", "D": "分析海灘剖面堆積物質的粒徑大小\n- 3 -\n100年指考 第 4 頁\n地理考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "19-20", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 85.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 97.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 12.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 85.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 68.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 95.0, 91.0, 83.0, 59.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "該地區的河川，由於上游人為攔截大量河水，中下游流量減少，常常造成無水入海\n的狀況。此水文現象可稱作：", "options": {"A": "斷流", "B": "伏流", "C": "襲奪", "D": "分洪"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "21-22", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 89.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 99.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 76.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 89.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 76.0, "discrimination": 23.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 97.0, 94.0, 87.0, 70.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 22, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "為解決該地區水源不足的問題，當代中國實施了跨流域調水工程。這些工程的實施，\n最可能是下列哪兩項？\n甲、遼河流域調向黃河流域；乙、長江流域調向黃河流域；丙、長江流域調向海河流\n域；丁、海河流域調向黃河流域；戊、長江流域調向珠江流域。", "options": {"A": "甲乙", "B": "乙丙", "C": "丙丁", "D": "丁戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "21-22", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 32.0, "B": 54.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 25.0, "B": 71.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 33.0, "B": 39.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 14.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 54.0, "p_high": 71.0, "p_low": 39.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 62.0, 53.0, 45.0, 36.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
