{"item_uid": "指考100-geography-025", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 25, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "該連鎖咖啡店主要是透過大量採購各種原\n料來壓低成本，但這種作法受到來自公平交\n易組織（FTOs）的質疑，尤其是咖啡豆的\n交易最受到關注。圖七中哪個地區，是公平\n貿易組織最關注的對象？", "options": {"A": "甲", "B": "乙", "C": "丙", "D": "丁\n圖七"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "25-26", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 30.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 60.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 19.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 78.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 39.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 40.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 60.0, "p_high": 78.0, "p_low": 40.0, "discrimination": 38.0, "p_quintiles": [82.0, 71.0, 62.0, 52.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
